        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "the corresponding domain. According to the methodology outlined in Section 2.3, the gender gaps  $ \\gamma_{X_{it}} $ for each province  $ (i = 1, \\ldots, 107) $ at time  $ t = 2019 $ were computed. Once the correction coefficient was applied, these values were transformed into the adjusted gender-gap metrics  $ \\Gamma_{X_{it}} $.",
