        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "For example, let  $ X_{it} $ be the ingredient Full-time equivalent employment rate of the Work domain. At time  $ t = 2019 $ and for the province  $ i = \\text{Turin} $, the indicator takes the following values:  $ \\tilde{x}_{\\text{Turin},2019}^m = 71.23 $,  $ \\tilde{x}_{\\text{Turin},2019}^w = 59.62 $, and  $ \\tilde{x}_{\\text{Turin},2019}^a = 65.43 $ (source: ISTAT, Labour Force Survey). The gender gap is measured by:",
